Relevant columns and how they will be used  
• POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX."POI_NAME": text we can fuzzy–filter with ILIKE to isolate “The Home Depot” and “Lowe’s Home Improvement”.  
• POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX."POI_ID": unique identifier that lets us join to addresses.  
• POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX."CATEGORY_MAIN"/"CATEGORY_ALTERNATE": optional extra check the POI really is a home‑improvement chain.  
• POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS."POI_ID": join key to bring a POI to its street address.  
• POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS."ADDRESS_ID": join key to US_ADDRESSES.  
• US_ADDRESSES."LATITUDE" & "LONGITUDE": coordinates we feed into ST_MAKEPOINT.  
• US_ADDRESSES."ADDRESS_ID": join key.  
Conditions that will probably be useful  
• WHERE "POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'  (for Home Depot)  
• WHERE "POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'  (for Lowe’s)  
• WHERE p."CATEGORY_MAIN" ILIKE '%home%improvement%' OR p."CATEGORY_ALTERNATE"::STRING ILIKE '%home%improvement%' (optional extra filter)  

Below are ten progressive Snowflake SQL example queries (each returns ≤ 20 rows) that lead from simple exploration to the final minimum‑distance answer.  
Every identifier is double‑quoted to comply with Snowflake quoting rules.

```sql
-- 1. Description:  Inspect a few POI names that contain “Home Depot”
SELECT DISTINCT 
       "POI_NAME"
FROM   "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"
WHERE  "POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description:  Inspect a few POI names that contain “Lowe’s Home Improvement”
SELECT DISTINCT 
       "POI_NAME"
FROM   "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"
WHERE  "POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description:  Get sample POI_IDs for “The Home Depot”
SELECT 
       "POI_ID",
       "POI_NAME"
FROM   "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"
WHERE  "POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
LIMIT  20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description:  Show one Home Depot’s address‑link rows
SELECT  p."POI_ID",
        r."ADDRESS_ID"
FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"        p
JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
       ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description:  Bring latitude / longitude for a handful of Home Depot stores
SELECT  p."POI_ID",
        a."LATITUDE",
        a."LONGITUDE"
FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"        p
JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
       ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"                   a
       ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description:  Confirm that Lowe’s stores likewise have coordinates
SELECT  p."POI_ID",
        a."LATITUDE",
        a."LONGITUDE"
FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"        p
JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
       ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"                   a
       ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description:  Compute the straight‑line distance (in miles) 
--                 between ONE sample Home Depot and ONE sample Lowe’s
WITH hd AS (
    SELECT  a."LATITUDE"  AS hd_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE" AS hd_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX" pi
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" pr
           ON pi."POI_ID" = pr."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES" a
           ON pr."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   pi."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
    LIMIT 1
),
lw AS (
    SELECT  a."LATITUDE"  AS lw_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE" AS lw_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX" pi
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" pr
           ON pi."POI_ID" = pr."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES" a
           ON pr."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   pi."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
    LIMIT 1
)
SELECT  ST_DISTANCE(
            ST_MAKEPOINT(hd.hd_lon, hd.hd_lat),
            ST_MAKEPOINT(lw.lw_lon, lw.lw_lat)
        ) / 1609 AS "DISTANCE_MILES"
FROM    hd, lw;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description:  For one Home Depot, show distance to every Lowe’s (preview of cross‑match)
WITH hd AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID",
            a."LATITUDE"  AS hd_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE" AS hd_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
    LIMIT 1
),
lws AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID"           AS lw_poi,
            a."LATITUDE"         AS lw_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE"        AS lw_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
)
SELECT  lws."lw_poi",
        ST_DISTANCE(
            ST_MAKEPOINT(hd.hd_lon, hd.hd_lat),
            ST_MAKEPOINT(lws.lw_lon, lws.lw_lat)
        )/1609 AS "DIST_MI"
FROM    hd, lws
ORDER BY "DIST_MI"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description:  For each Home Depot, return only the nearest Lowe’s store (core logic)
WITH home_depot AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID"       AS hd_poi,
            a."LATITUDE"     AS hd_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE"    AS hd_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
),
lowes AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID"       AS lw_poi,
            a."LATITUDE"     AS lw_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE"    AS lw_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
)
SELECT  hd."hd_poi"                        AS "HOME_DEPOT_POI_ID",
        lw."lw_poi"                        AS "LOWES_POI_ID",
        ST_DISTANCE(
            ST_MAKEPOINT(hd."hd_lon", hd."hd_lat"),
            ST_MAKEPOINT(lw."lw_lon", lw."lw_lat")
        ) / 1609                           AS "DISTANCE_MILES"
FROM    home_depot hd
CROSS JOIN lowes   lw
QUALIFY  ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY hd."hd_poi" 
                            ORDER BY "DISTANCE_MILES") = 1
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. Description:  Same as #9 but returns ALL Home Depot stores (no LIMIT) and
--                  orders the result for readability; this is effectively the final answer.
WITH home_depot AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID"       AS hd_poi,
            a."LATITUDE"     AS hd_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE"    AS hd_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%home%depot%'
),
lowes AS (
    SELECT  p."POI_ID"       AS lw_poi,
            a."LATITUDE"     AS lw_lat,
            a."LONGITUDE"    AS lw_lon
    FROM    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_INDEX"  p
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."POINT_OF_INTEREST_ADDRESSES_RELATIONSHIPS" r
           ON p."POI_ID" = r."POI_ID"
    JOIN    "US_REAL_ESTATE"."CYBERSYN"."US_ADDRESSES"             a
           ON r."ADDRESS_ID" = a."ADDRESS_ID"
    WHERE   p."POI_NAME" ILIKE '%lowe%home%improvement%'
)
SELECT  hd."hd_poi"                        AS "HOME_DEPOT_POI_ID",
        lw."lw_poi"                        AS "LOWES_POI_ID",
        ST_DISTANCE(
            ST_MAKEPOINT(hd."hd_lon", hd."hd_lat"),
            ST_MAKEPOINT(lw."lw_lon", lw."lw_lat")
        ) / 1609                           AS "DISTANCE_MILES"
FROM    home_depot hd
CROSS JOIN lowes   lw
QUALIFY  ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY hd."hd_poi" 
                            ORDER BY "DISTANCE_MILES") = 1
ORDER BY "DISTANCE_MILES";
```

