Table full name: US_REAL_ESTATE.CYBERSYN.HOME_MORTGAGE_DISCLOSURE_ATTRIBUTES
Column name: TOTAL_POINTS_AND_FEES Type: NUMBER Description: Total points and fees charged in connection with the loan (in USD)
Column name: OCCUPANCY_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Occupancy type for the home (principal residence, second residence, investment property)
Column name: CENSUSTRACT_MEDIAN_AGE_OF_HOUSING_UNITS Type: NUMBER Description: Tract median age of homes in the census tract
Column name: INTEREST_ONLY_PAYMENT Type: TEXT Description: If the contractual terms include interest-only payments
Column name: APPLICANT_ETHNICITY Type: TEXT Description: Ethnicity of the applicant
Column name: PRIMARY_DENIAL_REASON Type: TEXT Description: Principal reason for the denial of a mortgage
Column name: MSA_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the core based statistical area or metropolitan division where the property is located.
Column name: GSE_CONFORMING_LOAN_LIMIT Type: TEXT Description: If the reported loan amount exceeds the GSE (government sponsored enterprise) conforming loan limit
Column name: COUNTY_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the county where the property is located
Column name: ORIGINATION_CHARGES Type: NUMBER Description: Total of all itemized amounts that are designated borrower-paid at or before closing (in USD)
Column name: CO_APPLICANT_AGE Type: TEXT Description: Age of the co-applicant
Column name: CO_APPLICANT_SEX Type: TEXT Description: Sex of the co-applicant
Column name: INITIALLY_PAYABLE_TO_INSTITUTION Type: TEXT Description: If the obligation arising from the application was initially payable to the financial institution
Column name: MANUFACTURED_HOME_SECURED_PROPERTY_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: If the application is secured by a manufactured home and land, or by a manufactured home and not land
Column name: HOME_CONSTRUCTION_METHOD Type: TEXT Description: Construction method for the home (site-built, manufactured home)
Column name: MSA_GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier of the core based statistical area or metropolitan division where the property is located. Joinable to the GEOGRAPHY_INDEX table
Column name: STATE_GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier of the state where the property is located. Joinable to the GEOGRAPHY_INDEX table
Column name: APPLICANT_RACE Type: TEXT Description: Race of the applicant
Column name: APPLICANT_INCOME Type: NUMBER Description: Gross annual income relied on in making the credit decision (in USD)
Column name: FOR_BUSINESS_OR_COMMERCIAL_PURPOSE Type: TEXT Description: If the application is primarily for a business or commercial purpose
Column name: LIEN_STATUS Type: TEXT Description: Lien status of the property securing the loan
Column name: TOTAL_LOAN_COSTS Type: NUMBER Description: Amount of total loan costs in USD
Column name: STATE_NAME Type: TEXT Description: Name of the state where the property is located
Column name: PERCENT_MULTIFAMILY_AFFORDABLE_UNITS Type: FLOAT Description: Percentage of multifamily affordable units as a fraction of total units
Column name: CENSUSTRACT_MINORITY_POPULATION_PERCENT Type: FLOAT Description: Percentage of minority population to total population in the census tract
Column name: MANUFACTURED_HOME_LAND_PROPERTY_INTEREST Type: TEXT Description: Applicants land property interest in the land on which a manufactured home is located
Column name: RATE_SPREAD Type: FLOAT Description: Difference between APR & APOR for a comparable transaction as of the date the rate is set
Column name: ACTION_TAKEN Type: TEXT Description: Final application decision (e.g., Loan originated, Application denied, etc.)
Column name: NEGATIVE_AMORTIZATION Type: TEXT Description: If the contractual terms include a term that would cause the loan to be a negative amortization loan
Column name: CO_APPLICANT_RACE Type: TEXT Description: Race of the co-applicant
Column name: CO_APPLICANT_CREDIT_SCORE_SERVICE Type: TEXT Description: Credit scoring model used to generate the score relied on in the credit decision (e.g., VantageScore 3.0, Experian Fair Isaac)
Column name: APPLICATION_SUBMISSION_DESTINATION Type: TEXT Description: Whether the applicant or borrower submitted the application directly to the financial institution
Column name: TOTAL_HOUSING_UNITS Type: TEXT Description: Number of individual dwelling units related to the property securing the loan
Column name: CENSUSTRACT_POPULATION Type: NUMBER Description: Total population in the census tract
Column name: LOAN_TERM Type: NUMBER Description: Number of months after which the legal obligation will mature or terminate
Column name: HOEPA_HIGH_COST_MORTGAGE Type: TEXT Description: If the loan is a high-cost mortgage
Column name: APPLICANT_AGE Type: TEXT Description: Age of the applicant
Column name: MSA_MEDIAN_FAMILY_INCOME Type: NUMBER Description: Median family income for the MSA (via FFIEC)
Column name: COMBINED_LOAN_TO_VALUE_RATIO Type: NUMBER Description: Ratio of the total amount of debt secured by the property to the value of the property
Column name: INTRO_RATE_PERIOD Type: NUMBER Description: Number of months until the first date the interest rate may change after closing or account opening
Column name: PURCHASER_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Type of entity purchasing a loan from the institution (e.g., Fannie Mae, Freddie Mac, etc.)
Column name: OTHER_NONAMORTIZING_FEATURES Type: TEXT Description: If the contractual terms allow for payments other than fully amortizing, negative amortizing, balloon, or interest only payments
Column name: INTEREST_RATE Type: FLOAT Description: Interest rate of the loan
Column name: LOAN_AMOUNT Type: NUMBER Description: Amount of the loan or amount applied for
Column name: APPLICANT_AGE_ABOVE_62 Type: BOOLEAN Description: If the applicant age is above 62
Column name: PREPAYMENT_PENALTY_TERM Type: NUMBER Description: Term of any prepayment penalty in months
Column name: COUNTY_GEO_ID Type: TEXT Description: A unique identifier of the county where the property is located. Joinable to the GEOGRAPHY_INDEX table
Column name: OPEN_END_LINE_OF_CREDIT Type: TEXT Description: If the application is for an open-end line of credit
Column name: CO_APPLICANT_ETHNICITY Type: TEXT Description: Ethnicity of the co-applicant
Column name: REVERSE_MORTGAGE Type: TEXT Description: If the application is for a reverse mortgage
Column name: LOAN_TYPE Type: TEXT Description: Type of loan (Conventional, FHA, VA, RHS, or FSA)
